WEBVTT

00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:30.985
"it had been a really early one."

00:00:31.027 --> 00:00:33.738
I made some silly sleep joke
and she laughed,

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.573
and I went to go sit in my seat.

00:00:35.615 --> 00:00:38.117
She couldn't have been
more than 25 years old.

00:00:39.202 --> 00:00:41.621
During the flight,
we exchanged pleasantries,

00:00:41.621 --> 00:00:43.790
and at one point she came
to offer me a snack,

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:47.085
and she asked me what
I was going to New York to do.

00:00:47.502 --> 00:00:49.545
I said that I was going
to deliver a speech

00:00:49.545 --> 00:00:52.381
and that honestly,
I was cutting it kind of close.

00:00:52.423 --> 00:00:54.634
"No time for lunch?" she asked.

00:00:54.675 --> 00:00:56.052
“No time for lunch,” I said,

00:00:56.052 --> 00:00:57.345
and I took a bag of almonds

00:00:57.345 --> 00:00:59.722
and I tucked it into the pocket
of my backpack.